Z","pushed_at":"2026-03-11T11:26:45Z","git_url":"git://github.com/pytorch/pytorch.git","ssh_url":"org-21003710@github.com:pytorch/pytorch.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch","homepage":"https://pytorch.org","size":1267772,"stargazers_count":98201,"watchers_count":98201,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":27143,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":18135,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["autograd","deep-learning","gpu","machine-learning","neural-network","numpy","python","tensor"],"visibility":"public","forks":27143,"open_issues":18135,"watchers":98201,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/pulls/95759","html_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/95759","diff_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/95759.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/95759.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"__What?__\r\nFixes #85063 and #89320 and when mask values are `ScalarType::Half` (to be precise, `float16` didn't mask on my local machine)\r\n\r\nFurther changes:\r\n1. Minor typo in `torch/testing/_internal/common_device_type.py`\r\n\r\n__Why?__\r\n1. Restricting floating-point mask values to 0 or 1 threw errors on existing tests, so non-zero values are `True`. We could also `TORCH_CHECK` to prevent the use of floating-point, as opposed to Dispatch switch macros (tests failed when I didn't put `kBool` under the `ALL_TYPES` Dispatch macro).\r\n\r\ncc @jgong5 @mingfeima @XiaobingSuper @sa